Endpoints:


POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/profile  update profile

POST  http://localhost:5000/api/profile/compliance-documents

GET http://localhost:5000/api/workers  Get all workers

GET http://localhost:5000/api/workers/1  Get one worker

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/workers/1  Update a worker

GET http://localhost:5000/api/clients Get clients

POST http://localhost:5000/api/clients  Create a client

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/clients/1 Update a client

POST  http://localhost:5000/api/clients/1/assign   Assign a client to a worker

GET http://localhost:5000/api/roster   Roster endpoints

POST http://localhost:5000/api/roster  Create a roster shift

PATCH  http://localhost:5000/api/roster/1/status  Update care worker’s shift status

DELETE /api/clients/:clientId delete client 

DELETE /api/workers/:workerId   delete worker

POST http://localhost:5000/api/incidents  add the incidents

GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents   Get all incidents


GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents?status=OPEN
GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents?severity=HIGH
GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents?startDate=2026-09-01&endDate=2026-09-30

GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents?clientId=1  // incidents details

GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents/1  Get one incident

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/incidents/1  Update incident details

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/incidents/1/status   Change incident status

GET http://localhost:5000/api/incidents/1/activities  Get activity timeline

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/incidents/1   Delete incident